{"id":"n67898-4-9","stage":1,"title":"생기다 · 长","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n67898-4-9-1","ko":"여기에 내가 작은 상자 놔뒀는데 못 봤어?","zh":"我在这里放了一个小盒子，你没看到吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여기에","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"작은","meaning":"小， 矮","explanation":"작다：小， 矮；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"작다","audio":"/audio/bc42f85bf5be37c92f7c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69513","senseId":"1","lemma":"작다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"상자","meaning":"箱子","explanation":"상자：箱子","readings":[{"term":"상자","audio":"/audio/e6bb1dea433d8fa4cdb5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62801","senseId":"1","lemma":"상자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"놔뒀는데","meaning":"放下，放到","explanation":"놔두다：放下，放到；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"놔두다","audio":"/audio/dd6de8f290629bc419d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28326","senseId":"1","lemma":"놔두다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"못","meaning":"不会做动词所指的动作。","explanation":"못：不会做动词所指的动作。","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"봤어?","meaning":"看","explanation":"보다：看；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"bc42f85bf5be37c9","term":"작다","zh":"小， 矮","audio":"/audio/bc42f85bf5be37c92f7c.mp3","entryId":"69513","definition":"长度、宽度、体积等少于其他或一般尺寸。","pronunciation":["작ː따"]},{"id":"e6bb1dea433d8fa4","term":"상자","zh":"箱子","audio":"/audio/e6bb1dea433d8fa4cdb5.mp3","entryId":"62801","definition":"存放东西的木制或纸制四方形筒。","pronunciation":["상자"]},{"id":"dd6de8f290629bc4","term":"놔두다","zh":"放下，放到","audio":"/audio/dd6de8f290629bc419d9.mp3","entryId":"28326","definition":"把拿在手里的东西置于某个地方。","pronunciation":["놔ː두다"]},{"id":"89058d16546c1107","term":"못","zh":"不会做动词所指的动作。","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3","entryId":"17254","definition":"不会做动词所指的动作。","pronunciation":["몯ː"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"用眼睛识辨对象的存在或外观。","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/d55de4155cf25950c9a5.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n67898-4-9-2","ko":"어떻게 생긴 건데?","zh":"它长什么样啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"생긴","meaning":"长","explanation":"생기다：长；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"생기다","audio":"/audio/fc2a5a2e23bd6357d176.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67898","senseId":"4","lemma":"생기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"건데?","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ데：在句末提出背景、感想或含蓄的对照，留有后续语意；非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"fc2a5a2e23bd6357","term":"생기다","zh":"长","audio":"/audio/fc2a5a2e23bd6357d176.mp3","entryId":"67898","definition":"人或事物的长相成为某种样子。","pronunciation":["생기다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/4bff5328a8c890eba10f.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.37,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=67898","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"4","sourceLevel":"초급","day":32,"sequenceScore":1.3774,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我在这里放了一个小盒子，你没看到吗？","它长什么样啊？","上次看的那个电影真的很好看对吧？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我在这里放了一个小盒子，你没看到吗？","它长什么样啊？","上次看的那个电影真的很好看对吧？"],"answer":1}]}
